WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.569 --> 00:00:16.498
"What?" Daisy was insulted.

2
00:00:16.518 --> 00:00:19.180
"I didn't steal your pony!"

3
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.062
"Yes, you did!"

4
00:00:21.382 --> 00:00:23.103
The girl with the braid jutted out her chin.

5
00:00:24.284 --> 00:00:25.545
Henry recognized the girl.

6
00:00:26.406 --> 00:00:29.028
She lived in West Belltown, and her name was Rebecca.

7
00:00:29.964 --> 00:00:33.166
But he didn't know her very well, since she was a grade ahead of him in school.

8
00:00:34.286 --> 00:00:35.807
Rebecca stomped over to the pony.

9
00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:41.230
"Everyone knows I wanted to ride Coco in the show today," she said, giving the pony a hug.

10
00:00:42.231 --> 00:00:45.372
Daisy pulled on the lead rope to move the pony away from Rebecca.

11
00:00:45.392 --> 00:00:49.274
"I wanted to ride her today too," she said.

12
00:00:49.294 --> 00:00:53.357
"I've been riding her in my lessons for the past month."

13
00:00:53.377 --> 00:00:56.118
"Me too," Rebecca said.

14
00:00:56.158 --> 00:00:57.979
"Wait a minute."

15
00:00:58.159 --> 00:00:59.260
Henry was confused.

16
00:01:00.204 --> 00:01:03.947
"How can both of you ride the same pony at the same time?"

17
00:01:05.168 --> 00:01:08.211
Daisy looked surprised, as if she'd forgotten Henry was listening.

18
00:01:08.231 --> 00:01:12.114
"We don't ride her at the same time," she said.

19
00:01:12.134 --> 00:01:15.857
"Rebecca and I take lessons on different days."

20
00:01:15.877 --> 00:01:18.519
"Oh," Henry said.

21
00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:21.301
Then he remembered something Maggie had told him.

22
00:01:21.321 --> 00:01:25.725
"But wait, why can't you both ride Coco in the show?

23
00:01:26.765 --> 00:01:29.648
Maggie said a boy is riding Big Spot today too."

24
00:01:30.884 --> 00:01:36.487
"Maggie is riding in the beginner classes for people under age eleven," Daisy explained.

25
00:01:36.507 --> 00:01:42.310
"The boy is riding later, in the advanced classes for older riders.

26
00:01:43.231 --> 00:01:47.173
Big Spot will have plenty of time to rest in between classes."

27
00:01:48.294 --> 00:01:50.175
Rebecca nodded, still looking angry.

28
00:01:50.195 --> 00:01:55.658
"My class is right before Daisy's class, so Coco can only do one or the other.

29
00:01:56.758 --> 00:01:59.560
And I was supposed to ride Coco until she stole her!"

30
00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:01.641
Daisy rolled her eyes.

31
00:02:01.661 --> 00:02:05.204
"I didn't steal Coco from you," she said.

32
00:02:05.224 --> 00:02:10.048
"We chose straws to decide who'd get to ride her in the show.

33
00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:13.651
You lost when you got the short straw.

34
00:02:14.632 --> 00:02:18.795
It was a fair way to decide, so you should just forget about it!"

35
00:02:18.815 --> 00:02:20.877
"Don't tell me what to do!"

36
00:02:21.157 --> 00:02:22.858
Rebecca yelled, clenching her fists.

37
00:02:22.878 --> 00:02:25.300
"Anyway, you'll be sorry!"

38
00:02:26.321 --> 00:02:27.202
She stomped away.

39
00:02:27.902 --> 00:02:29.504
Daisy stared after the other girl.

40
00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.261
"Wow," she said.

41
00:02:32.281 --> 00:02:35.023
"Rebecca seems really mad at me."

42
00:02:36.204 --> 00:02:36.905
Henry nodded.

43
00:02:36.925 --> 00:02:39.707
"Do you think she's mad enough to steal your shirt?"

44
00:02:40.828 --> 00:02:42.028
Daisy's eyes widened.

45
00:02:42.048 --> 00:02:45.731
"Definitely!" she exclaimed.

46
00:02:46.732 --> 00:02:49.694
"Maybe she thought that would make me drop out of the show.

47
00:02:50.695 --> 00:02:53.457
Then she'd be able to ride Coco after all."

48
00:02:53.477 --> 00:02:57.500
"That seems like a pretty good motive," Henry agreed.

49
00:02:58.484 --> 00:03:01.446
Just then he noticed some people standing by the lemonade stand.

50
00:03:02.346 --> 00:03:04.427
He said good-bye to Daisy and hurried back to work.

51
00:03:05.428 --> 00:03:08.610
Henry thought about the case as he poured lemonade and collected quarters.

52
00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.291
Could Rebecca be the shirt thief?

53
00:03:12.712 --> 00:03:13.672
She had a good motive.

54
00:03:14.373 --> 00:03:16.734
And it was very busy and crowded at the stable today.

55
00:03:17.735 --> 00:03:20.496
She probably could have grabbed the shirt without anyone seeing her.

56
00:03:21.497 --> 00:03:23.978
Maybe Cole would come back from the barn with some good clues.

57
00:03:23.998 --> 00:03:27.360
"Hello, Henry," a familiar voice said.

58
00:03:28.156 --> 00:03:28.837
"How's business?"

59
00:03:29.937 --> 00:03:30.638
Henry looked up.

60
00:03:31.238 --> 00:03:32.819
Maggie's father was smiling at him.

61
00:03:32.839 --> 00:03:35.961
"Hi, Uncle Bruce," Henry said.

62
00:03:35.981 --> 00:03:38.022
"Would you like some lemonade?"

63
00:03:39.182 --> 00:03:42.084
"Sure." Uncle Bruce reached into his pocket for a quarter.

64
00:03:42.104 --> 00:03:45.966
"I'm getting thirsty standing around waiting to watch Maggie ride."

65
00:03:47.087 --> 00:03:48.568
Henry glanced over at the barn.

66
00:03:48.588 --> 00:03:52.150
"Hey, Uncle Bruce, can you do me a favor?"

67
00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:53.911
"Sure, Henry.

68
00:03:53.971 --> 00:03:54.411
What is it?"

69
00:03:54.711 --> 00:03:55.412
his uncle said.

70
00:03:56.448 --> 00:03:58.930
"Will you watch the lemonade stand for a few minutes?"

71
00:03:59.290 --> 00:03:59.890
Henry said.

72
00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:02.192
"I need to go find Cole."

73
00:04:03.172 --> 00:04:03.752
"No problem."

74
00:04:04.353 --> 00:04:06.054
Uncle Bruce stepped behind the table.

75
00:04:07.455 --> 00:04:09.796
"Step right up for Belltown's best lemonade!"

76
00:04:10.036 --> 00:04:11.217
he called to a passing woman.

77
00:04:11.237 --> 00:04:13.798
"Thanks," Henry told him.

78
00:04:13.818 --> 00:04:15.900
"I'll be back in a few minutes."

79
00:04:20.683 --> 00:04:22.744
When Henry entered the barn, it was very busy.

80
00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.281
Ponies were standing in stalls and tied in the aisles.

81
00:04:27.241 --> 00:04:30.542
Lots of kids were running around with grooming tools or saddles and bridles.

82
00:04:31.582 --> 00:04:34.443
Henry dodged around a fat brown pony, looking for Cole.

83
00:04:35.683 --> 00:04:38.964
He didn't see Cole, but he spotted Maggie near Big Spot's stall.

84
00:04:40.105 --> 00:04:41.125
"Have you seen Cole?"

85
00:04:41.365 --> 00:04:42.805
Henry asked, hurrying over.

86
00:04:42.825 --> 00:04:46.106
"Nope." Maggie fiddled with her pony's halter.

87
00:04:46.126 --> 00:04:49.407
"Haven't seen him since I left the lemonade stand."

88
00:04:49.427 --> 00:04:52.308
"That's weird," Henry muttered.

89
00:04:53.472 --> 00:04:56.014
Then he noticed Daisy leading her pony into the barn.

90
00:04:57.255 --> 00:05:00.217
She stopped in front of a stall a few doors down from Big Spot's.

91
00:05:00.237 --> 00:05:02.799
"Is that Coco's stall?"

92
00:05:03.099 --> 00:05:04.060
Henry asked Maggie.

93
00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:06.401
"Yeah," Maggie said.

94
00:05:06.421 --> 00:05:08.703
"You should go look for clues there."

95
00:05:08.723 --> 00:05:11.925
"That's what Cole is supposed to be doing."

96
00:05:12.866 --> 00:05:14.847
Henry started walking toward Coco's stall.

97
00:05:15.768 --> 00:05:19.991
But he had to stop when a dark-haired girl led a dapple-gray pony out of the stall next

98
00:05:20.031 --> 00:05:20.692
to Big Spot's.

99
00:05:21.908 --> 00:05:24.050
"Excuse me," the girl said with a smile.

100
00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:25.932
Henry smiled back.

101
00:05:26.692 --> 00:05:29.475
The girl was about Daisy's age, but he didn't recognize her.

102
00:05:30.616 --> 00:05:32.197
Suddenly Henry's smile faded.

103
00:05:33.218 --> 00:05:38.283
The girl's shirt had long sleeves, a high collar, and a strip of polka-dotted ribbon on the front

104
00:05:38.323 --> 00:05:40.165
pocket. "You!"

105
00:05:40.505 --> 00:05:41.185
he blurted out.

106
00:05:41.206 --> 00:05:43.708
"You took Daisy's show shirt!"
